      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790929143290,
      "created": 1790927110992,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DataAbsenController\n\n- kantorYgAkanDisimpanDataAbsenDariApiKeDB\n  - ListKantor ditampilkan (list kantor beserta bulan 1 - 12)\n\n- simpanDataAbsenDariApiKeDB\n  - DataAbsen -> \n  - List Kantor -> kolom bulan diubah jadi 1 \n    - Redirect ke PIC Controller @index (pic/dashboard/pic) kehadiran rekapan\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "UqYiks-61TE4qsIj0DvCn",
      "originalText": "DataAbsenController\n\n- kantorYgAkanDisimpanDataAbsenDariApiKeDB\n  - ListKantor ditampilkan (list kantor beserta bulan 1 - 12)\n\n- simpanDataAbsenDariApiKeDB\n  - DataAbsen -> \n  - List Kantor -> kolom bulan diubah jadi 1 \n    - Redirect ke PIC Controller @index (pic/dashboard/pic) kehadiran rekapan\n    ",
